@SayNoToTrading That’s the main problem of the algorithm. It’s a vicious cycle. Popular creators talk about a certain stock, it reaches a lot of readers - other creators start to talk about the stock because it reaches those readers -> even more readers will see the stock -> … 

In the end posts about less popular stocks get punished but when you say something about IREN that has been told already by 1.000 other creators, you get a lot of impressions. 

Originality gets punished.

