@DevMarketWatch I work for a manufacturing company myself. We see the difficulties of keeping our margins on special products. Small problems in the supply chain can cause big problems in the margins of big custom-made projects.

Fluence, who reported a couple of weeks ago, had exactly the same problem on two of their customized projects.

The problem is, when your main revenue comes from customized projects instead of standardized products, your consolidated margin takes a big hit immediately.

